  "problem": "Suppose that ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/46833dd7644e5c60bb4525fe4e7649a99752b26096331755a4b44c2abe183f11.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/ab4817775494786b06f0b9cecf225ea5979c035b69c36c1fa078f835524be9e9.svg) are continuous random variables. It is known that the conditional probability density function ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/939d0476e164e1f946f2c1f56829e1d23d0f14cf794d59ed194139e9ca0c6633.svg) is given by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/01cc971ff9be09d98f7b82c17dcb437308e0db1bb748bfad31f76a1f5be54828.svg)\nand that\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/267e370c58b7350ddf932adcbe95f9b51a895c4d970f2d5ed8313bfd050a215c.svg)\nWhat is the conditional variance ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/fc8d9d3eba8e082c14369171fd86c8786ec9efbb70b3d6a840f4cec11740be79.svg)\n\nThe conditional variance of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/ab4817775494786b06f0b9cecf225ea5979c035b69c36c1fa078f835524be9e9.svg) given ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/2cc57b1c8b00862c078193ea1774f4012e1513ab1a26a6d5bb806e046220a812.svg) is defined by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/82fb648d48cfe25c760b67838480f3b464ae25f5107a13fbecea46b1d47f543c.svg)\n\nwhere \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/b1ba1db07783ff23a06aff81a65993cc776777cdb471c20074d3ceac8db820a1.svg)\n\nTherefore, we obtain \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/daf6a9ae8a295a2120e9720260b9c62d984774107bc2fc2308d60f027ac5f0d4.svg)\n\nFinally,\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14219346/assets/97c0423f3c9f02779731969b447d9fa6040eb7637e541d7cdcdb9e68037477d7.svg)",
